      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我推上传的照片实在太棒了！\n你看一下啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621163A84E0A4F207684716772475B9E5728592A68D24E86FF01000A4F60770B4E004E0B554AFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉小姐和麻麻鳗鱼王\n在长椅上放松的这个画面也太好看了吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C83895C0F59D0548C9EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738B000A5728957F69054E0A653E677E76848FD94E2A753B97624E5F592A597D770B4E865427FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想坐在这张长椅上，\n和雷电兽一起拍照！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3575057288FD95F20957F69054E0AFF0C000A548C96F77535517D4E008D7762CD7167FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我想拜托你的就是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE50010000201000000FF0C000A621160F362DC62584F6076845C31662F2026202600100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你帮我找到\n照片里的长椅吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F605E2E6211627E5230000A7167724791CC7684957F69055427FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噼里啪电！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "567C91CC556A7535FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要确认\n拍到长椅的照片吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981786E8BA4000A62CD5230957F69057684716772475417FF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请给我看照片",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77ED96211770B716772470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不用看了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7528770B4E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是这张！\n你看得出是哪里的长椅吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8FD95F20FF01000A4F60770B5F9751FA662F54EA91CC7684957F69055417FF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你帮我找到\n照片里的长椅吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F605E2E6211627E5230000A7167724791CC7684957F69055427FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "发现了委托人\n正在寻找的长椅！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D173B04E8659D462584EBA000A6B6357285BFB627E7684957F6905FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "2个并排摆放的种植盆！\n背后的大楼！还有山！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00324E2A5E7663926446653E768479CD690D76C6FF01000A80CC540E76845927697CFF018FD867095C71FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉小姐的照片\n就是在这里拍的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C83895C0F59D0768471677247000A5C31662F57288FD991CC62CD7684FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我赶紧……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362118D767D2720262026FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我坐上了卡娜莉小姐坐过的长椅，\n那我就等于是卡娜莉小姐本人！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621157504E0A4E8653615A1C83895C0F59D057508FC77684957F6905FF0C000A90A362115C317B494E8E662F53615A1C83895C0F59D0672C4EBAFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n请你按照和卡娜莉小姐的照片相同的感觉<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n帮我拍照好吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8BF74F6063097167548C53615A1C83895C0F59D076847167724776F8540C7684611F89C900100001BE00000A5E2E621162CD7167597D5417FF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望你能完全还原\n这张照片的角度！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E0C671B4F6080FD5B8C51688FD8539F000A8FD95F2071677247768489D25EA6FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你想确认照片，\n请随时叫我！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4F6060F3786E8BA471677247FF0C000A8BF7968F65F653EB6211FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要确认卡娜莉小姐的照片吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981786E8BA453615A1C83895C0F59D07684716772475417FF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确认！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E8BA4FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不用<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D752800100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请按照和卡娜莉小姐的照片相同的感觉，\n从稍微远一点的地方拍照！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF763097167548C53615A1C83895C0F59D076847167724776F8540C7684611F89C9FF0C000A4ECE7A0D5FAE8FDC4E0070B97684573065B962CD7167FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯嗯！\n那附近……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55EFFF01000A90A396448FD12026202600100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好像不对。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n角度好像有点不一样……\n毕竟我的目标是完全还原嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D50CF4E0D5BF9300200100001BE01000A89D25EA6597D50CF670970B94E0D4E00683720262026000A6BD57ADF6211768476EE6807662F5B8C51688FD8539F561BFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是那里！\n请在那个位置拍照！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F90A391CCFF01000A8BF7572890A34E2A4F4D7F6E62CD7167FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啦好～啦！\n我看看照片！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5566597DFF5E5566FF01000A6211770B770B71677247FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇哦！完全还原了！\n感觉就像我变成了卡娜莉小姐一样！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C754E6FF015B8C51688FD8539F4E86FF01000A611F89C95C3150CF621153D862104E8653615A1C83895C0F59D04E006837FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把你帮我拍的照片\n发到社交平台……了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A4F605E2E621162CD768471677247000A53D15230793E4EA45E7353F0202620264E86FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来，给卡娜莉小姐拍照的\n会不会是那位传闻中的制作人呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C7ED953615A1C83895C0F59D062CD71677684000A4F1A4E0D4F1A662F90A34F4D4F2095FB4E2D768452364F5C4EBA5462FF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然卡娜莉面包也不错，\n但我想要的是立牌或钥匙扣啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713653615A1C8389976253054E5F4E0D9519FF0C000A4F46621160F389817684662F7ACB724C621694A553196263554A300200100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开玩笑的啦！我还有其他\n模仿卡娜莉小姐的照片要拍！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n毕竟我是冲着这个来密阿雷的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F0073A97B1176845566FF0162118FD8670951764ED6000A6A214EFF53615A1C83895C0F59D0768471677247898162CDFF0100100001BE00000A6BD57ADF6211662F51B277408FD94E2A67655BC6963F96F77684FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，你也辛苦啦！\n来都来了，你不在长椅放松一下吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C4F604E5F8F9B82E65566FF01000A676590FD67654E86FF0C4F604E0D5728957F6905653E677E4E004E0B5417FF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "再见啦～！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "518D89C15566FF5EFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
